.tran 1n 5m
Vin in 0 208
M1 in gate1 sw1 0 NMOS W=0.3 L=0.2
M2 in gate2 sw2 0 NMOS W=0.5 L=0.4
M3 in gate3 sw3 0 NMOS W=0.7 L=0.6
D1 0 sw1 DIODE
D2 0 sw2 DIODE
D3 0 sw3 DIODE
L1 sw1 out 10u
L2 sw2 out 15u
L3 sw3 out 20u
C1 out 0 300u
Rload out 0 2.2222
Vgate gate1 0 PULSE(0 208 0 1n 1n 100ns 500ns)
Vgate2 gate2 0 PULSE(0 208 0 1n 1n 150ns 600ns)
Vgate3 gate3 0 PULSE(0 208 0 1n 1n 200ns 700ns)
.model NMOS NMOS(Vto=1 Kp=2 Lambda=0)
.model DIODE D
Rbleed sw1 0 1Meg
Rbleed sw2 0 1Meg
Rbleed sw3 0 1Meg
.end
